00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:18.173
E a touch of Parmesan cheese.

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:21.060
And after, we put olive oil from Puglia,

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:22.180
is out of Italy as well.

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:23.013
- Wow.

00:02:23.013 --> 00:02:26.163
