00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:53.210
When cook already, I take the peel and I leave it down.

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:55.453
It's don't burn the pizza.
- Okay.

00:02:55.787 --> 00:02:58.420
- This is margarita, is a proper Neapolitan pizza.

00:02:58.420 --> 00:02:59.993
Come over there.
- Okay.

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:02.200
- Turn, and go slowly, slowly.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.273
