00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:38.048
Is good, maybe is better than my one. (laughs)

00:03:38.048 --> 00:03:38.881
Let's go for taste.

00:03:38.881 --> 00:03:40.381
- Let's go for it.

00:03:42.113 --> 00:03:44.330
- Like this, don't do like this because everything go down.

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:45.930
- This is the proper way to eat it.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:47.930
